        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is applicable to as-cast or wrought eutectic high-entropy alloys.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention should be effective at room temperature and at elevated temperatures up to 900 °C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryo-rolling and annealing produce a refined lamellar microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryo-rolling and annealing increase the density of beneficial defects.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined microstructure and introduced defects promote work hardening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention reduces stress concentrations at grain boundaries.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced work hardening and reduced grain-boundary stress concentration improve both strength and ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryo-rolling and annealing can increase strength by up to 50% relative to an as-cast or wrought state without that treatment.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryo-rolling and annealing can increase ductility by up to 20% relative to an as-cast or wrought state without that treatment.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The untreated as-cast or wrought eutectic high-entropy alloy is the appropriate baseline.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
